# Copy to .dev.vars and fill in before running `pnpm dev`. Never commit real values.
#
# LOCAL ONLY: these two are for `wrangler dev` / standalone runs. Production uses
# `wrangler secret` values — minting against the deployed worker with the local
# HODOR_JWT_SECRET fails with `401 Invalid secret` (and vice versa).
#
# Secrets (set these via `wrangler secret put` in production)
# Generate with: openssl rand -base64 32
HODOR_ENCRYPTION_KEY=
# Generate with: openssl rand -hex 32
HODOR_JWT_SECRET=

# Standalone runtime only (Node/Bun): unstorage backend. Omit for memory, or
# set HODOR_KV_DRIVER=memory / HODOR_KV_DATA_DIR=./.data/kv for an fs-backed one.
# HODOR_KV_DRIVER=memory
# HODOR_KV_DATA_DIR=.data/kv